00:12:06.824 --> 00:12:09.054
Damn, I guess we have no choice. Hang on to me!

00:12:10.424 --> 00:12:12.824
Wow, Miss Yuri is carrying me on her back!

00:12:12.824 --> 00:12:14.314
I'm in bliss!

00:12:15.694 --> 00:12:17.634
It's slippery!

00:12:17.964 --> 00:12:21.274
A fragile girl clinging desperately to a boy...

00:12:21.274 --> 00:12:23.804
I'm a girl myself, but I must admit that it is adorable.

00:12:23.804 --> 00:12:25.804
Hey, wait!

00:12:25.804 --> 00:12:30.474
What do they think when they see ME
carrying a girl on my back like this?!

00:12:37.284 --> 00:12:40.584
Whoa! Is that some kind of
enormous insectivorous plant?!

00:12:40.584 --> 00:12:42.694
I'd expect nothing less from
Sakuramori's famous race!

00:12:42.694 --> 00:12:45.524
Hollywood's special effects have nothing on us!

00:12:46.394 --> 00:12:48.554
There's no way they have a stunt like that!

00:12:51.934 --> 00:12:53.064
Oh my gosh!

00:12:53.064 --> 00:12:57.674
Maika! I don't know why, but what's in
the book has become unstable!

00:12:57.674 --> 00:13:01.434
I don't know what to expect!
You'd better drop out of the race!

00:13:01.714 --> 00:13:04.044
But, what about the MVP?

00:13:05.444 --> 00:13:08.454
I'll hold this thing down! You two go on ahead!

00:13:08.454 --> 00:13:11.554
I can't believe I'm so physically close to Miss Yuri!

00:13:11.554 --> 00:13:13.144
I'm in bliss!

00:13:13.654 --> 00:13:15.194
But this is more than you can handle by yourself!

00:13:15.194 --> 00:13:17.764
We can't just walk away from people
who are in trouble!

00:13:17.764 --> 00:13:20.024
Bye, guys! We'll see you later!

00:13:20.024 --> 00:13:21.164
GRRR!

00:13:21.164 --> 00:13:24.164
Kurosu! We won't waste your sacrifice!

00:13:24.164 --> 00:13:24.964
Huh?

00:13:28.034 --> 00:13:29.904
Check it out! It looks like a trap!

00:13:29.904 --> 00:13:31.244
Hey, couldn't you just jump over that?!

00:13:31.244 --> 00:13:33.274
What's up with this race?

00:13:33.274 --> 00:13:34.674
I can't take this anymore!

00:13:34.674 --> 00:13:36.244
I'm gonna quit too...

00:13:36.244 --> 00:13:39.704
The terror of this race is forcing the contestants
to drop out one by one!

00:13:42.414 --> 00:13:43.714
Mamiya!

00:13:48.824 --> 00:13:50.154
Cooking...

00:13:52.724 --> 00:13:54.024
Thanks!

00:13:55.434 --> 00:13:56.224
Haruo!

00:13:56.394 --> 00:13:57.234
Big Brother!

00:13:57.234 --> 00:13:59.434
Wait! Don't do it!

00:13:59.434 --> 00:14:03.424
Don't you care if a witch who's much more
evil than you becomes MVP?

00:14:05.374 --> 00:14:06.404
I'm gonna fall!

00:14:06.404 --> 00:14:11.774
Big Brother... I must be cruel
in order to protect you!

00:14:12.284 --> 00:14:15.254
I'm devoting myself to this game
even if I have to kill my emotions!

00:14:15.254 --> 00:14:17.744
It sounds like I'm a tragic heroine or something!

00:14:17.824 --> 00:14:21.014
Oh, it feels like I'm gonna fly away
somewhere right now!

00:14:21.354 --> 00:14:22.114
Huh?!

00:14:26.864 --> 00:14:29.594
Check it out! It looks like another trap
has been activated!

00:14:29.594 --> 00:14:32.004
Maika and Marin have now become a star!

00:14:32.004 --> 00:14:33.194
Maika!

00:14:39.174 --> 00:14:42.074
You saved my life! Thanks, Mamiya!

00:14:42.074 --> 00:14:44.044
That was nothing to thank me for!

00:14:44.044 --> 00:14:47.444
Since we're a pair, I just didn't want you
to drop out, that's all!

00:14:50.514 --> 00:14:54.424
Whoa, check it out! Miss Yuri and the
Vice President are back with a fury!

00:14:54.424 --> 00:14:56.854
What happened to the enormous
insectivorous plant on the rooftop?

00:14:56.854 --> 00:14:58.594
This is unbelievable!

00:14:58.594 --> 00:15:02.494
Its tentacles are tied in bows and its
body is completely tied up and knocked out!

00:15:02.894 --> 00:15:04.264
WHOA!

00:15:04.264 --> 00:15:06.564
A huge brick wall trap has appeared
in front of Miss Yuri!

00:15:06.834 --> 00:15:07.994
Yahoo!

00:15:11.104 --> 00:15:12.034
Yuri?!

00:15:13.004 --> 00:15:14.614
Hey, why the hell are you still holding my hand?

00:15:14.614 --> 00:15:17.174
They got ahead of us thanks to YOU!

00:15:20.544 --> 00:15:22.914
Ow...

00:15:23.414 --> 00:15:25.124
Where are we?

00:15:25.124 --> 00:15:26.814
Wh-What's going on?

00:15:27.224 --> 00:15:30.154
All right, it looks like some info just came in!

00:15:30.394 --> 00:15:35.364
It looks like volunteers from various sports clubs
seeking larger budgets and more club room space

00:15:35.364 --> 00:15:38.764
have been placed all along
the race course to act as obstacles

00:15:38.764 --> 00:15:42.304
in this year's Sakuramori
famous girls-only ultra race!

00:15:42.304 --> 00:15:44.704
We're here to interrupt you during the race!

00:15:44.704 --> 00:15:47.194
Here we go! Take this!

00:15:49.474 --> 00:15:50.634
Birdlime?!

00:15:51.184 --> 00:15:55.644
Can they evade the volleyball club
members' birdlime attack?

00:15:56.154 --> 00:15:58.984
That would be nothing IF I could use magic here...

00:15:58.984 --> 00:16:01.514
Allow me to take care of them!

00:16:02.994 --> 00:16:05.154
We may be struggling, but we'll be okay!

00:16:12.234 --> 00:16:14.534
You did it, Nijihara! That was brilliant!

00:16:14.534 --> 00:16:15.934
Come on, let's...

00:16:17.334 --> 00:16:19.474
It's so slimy!

00:16:19.474 --> 00:16:21.904
We don't have all day, Haruo!

00:16:22.214 --> 00:16:23.144
Ayumi!

00:16:23.144 --> 00:16:24.074
Big Brother!

00:16:24.074 --> 00:16:26.804
Nijihara, I won't waste your sacrifice!

00:16:27.684 --> 00:16:30.084
What a cunning and evil witch you are!

00:16:31.984 --> 00:16:33.854
It's the members of the soccer club!

00:16:35.524 --> 00:16:37.424
We are here to interrupt you during the race!

00:16:37.424 --> 00:16:40.884
We'll let no one pass us!

00:16:41.064 --> 00:16:42.554
The ball is my friend!

00:16:43.594 --> 00:16:45.594
Miss Yuri, please use me!

00:16:46.534 --> 00:16:47.624
Thanks, Umi!

00:16:57.214 --> 00:16:58.734
Now we're saved, Umi!

00:17:00.084 --> 00:17:02.614
I got to be useful to Miss Yuri!

00:17:02.614 --> 00:17:04.244
I'm in bliss!

00:17:05.854 --> 00:17:11.764
Err... Wh-What's up with these
depressing looking people?

00:17:11.764 --> 00:17:14.664
For some reason, I identify with them...

00:17:14.664 --> 00:17:17.394
We are here to interrupt you during the race.

00:17:17.394 --> 00:17:19.704
We're the fun and lively ping pong club!

00:17:19.704 --> 00:17:20.974
How are you "fun and lively"?!

00:17:20.974 --> 00:17:23.594
Take this! Our ping pong balls filled with passion!

00:17:27.404 --> 00:17:28.174
Take that!

00:17:30.074 --> 00:17:30.734
Take that!

00:17:31.484 --> 00:17:33.384
What the hell is this?

00:17:33.384 --> 00:17:34.214
Dunno...

00:17:36.284 --> 00:17:38.954
We are here to interrupt you during the race.

00:17:38.954 --> 00:17:41.754
We're the fun and lively ping pong club!

00:17:41.754 --> 00:17:44.814
I don't really know what's going on,
but keep your head up and hang in there.

00:17:44.994 --> 00:17:47.294
Now the race has reached the final phase!

00:17:47.294 --> 00:17:48.364
FINAL AREA
Now the race has reached the final phase!

00:17:48.364 --> 00:17:51.664
FINAL AREA
Each contestant will get on a randomly selected
vehicle which is hidden inside the closed-off tent

00:17:51.664 --> 00:17:52.934
FINAL AREA
and start heading for the goal!

00:17:52.934 --> 00:17:53.564
And start heading for the goal!

00:17:53.564 --> 00:17:55.334
All right, here we go!

00:18:03.044 --> 00:18:05.544
What the... What's going on?

00:18:05.544 --> 00:18:07.584
It looks like something awful is happening!

00:18:07.584 --> 00:18:08.914
I see gas shooting out from the course!

00:18:08.914 --> 00:18:10.714
Things are literally burning up now!

00:18:10.714 --> 00:18:13.554
Will anyone make it out of there
and reach the goal?

00:18:13.554 --> 00:18:17.424
What's going on?! The book's going wacky!
I can't control it!

00:18:17.994 --> 00:18:21.864
We have to hurry up and finish this race,
or who knows WHAT might happen!

00:18:21.964 --> 00:18:22.764
Let's go!

00:18:24.134 --> 00:18:27.664
I get to ride a two-seater bicycle with Miss Yuri!

00:18:27.664 --> 00:18:29.664
I'm in bliss!

00:18:32.904 --> 00:18:34.234
What the heck's going on?!

00:18:35.614 --> 00:18:37.884
We're going to drop out after all this?!

00:18:37.884 --> 00:18:40.114
I'm so NOT in bliss!

00:18:40.344 --> 00:18:43.914
Dammit! If they think this can stop me,
they're wrong!

00:18:50.154 --> 00:18:52.424
Maika is so close to the goal!

00:18:52.424 --> 00:18:54.394
The glory of the MVP title is right
in front of her eyes!

00:18:55.094 --> 00:18:57.034
I can win this! I know I can win this!

00:18:57.034 --> 00:18:59.154
I'm going to be the MVP!

00:18:59.534 --> 00:19:04.004
I can't believe my big brother is going to
kiss me while everyone watches!

00:19:04.004 --> 00:19:07.994
This is just like... This is just like a dream!
How electrifying!

00:19:15.284 --> 00:19:16.944
I-I got electrocuted!

00:19:17.114 --> 00:19:19.954
Oh, no! Maika got hit by lightning
right in front of the goal

00:19:19.954 --> 00:19:21.654
and was unfortunately forced to drop out!

00:19:21.654 --> 00:19:25.564
Now it looks like the outcome of the race is going
to be determined by these two people plus one!

00:19:25.564 --> 00:19:28.654
Miss Yuri on a unicycle!

00:19:30.294 --> 00:19:32.664
Ayumi, who's charging with deadly speed
wearing inline skates,

00:19:32.664 --> 00:19:34.154
and a person who's not even worth mentioning!

00:19:40.174 --> 00:19:41.804
Setting the VCR...

00:19:42.374 --> 00:19:43.874
I'm gonna charge!

00:19:43.874 --> 00:19:44.784
What?

00:19:44.784 --> 00:19:46.304
Mamiya!

00:19:53.254 --> 00:19:54.424
I did it!

00:19:54.424 --> 00:19:56.154
I'm the MVP!

00:19:56.854 --> 00:19:59.124
Why you... Big Sister...

00:19:59.124 --> 00:20:01.724
I won't let that happen!

00:20:05.334 --> 00:20:06.164
What?

00:20:06.164 --> 00:20:07.034
What the...

00:20:09.534 --> 00:20:11.164
Look out!

00:20:20.644 --> 00:20:22.614
GOAL!

00:20:22.614 --> 00:20:28.054
The winner of Sakaramori's famous girls-only
ultra race is Ayumi Mamiya!

00:20:33.894 --> 00:20:36.764
Looks like it stopped before it turned
into a complete disaster.

00:20:37.764 --> 00:20:39.904
Rika? What's the matter?

00:20:39.904 --> 00:20:42.394
I just came here for a little pest extermination.

00:20:46.444 --> 00:20:50.074
Damn you! You're gonna pay for this, Big Sister!

00:20:50.374 --> 00:20:50.644
CLOSING CEREMONY

00:20:50.644 --> 00:20:55.514
CLOSING CEREMONY
Well, we have safely completed all of the
events for this year's sports festival.

00:20:55.514 --> 00:20:59.454
CLOSING CEREMONY
Thanks to everyone's enthusiasm, the
sports festival turned out to be a big success.

00:20:59.454 --> 00:20:59.974
Thanks to everyone's enthusiasm, the
sports festival turned out to be a big success.

00:21:00.084 --> 00:21:02.654
Now I'd like to move on to
the announcement of the MVP.

00:21:02.654 --> 00:21:06.284
Everyone did an excellent job this year.

00:21:06.524 --> 00:21:09.394
And the person who earned this title
by a narrow margin is...

00:21:09.394 --> 00:21:12.404
Miss Chiaki Yoshikawa from Class 1-A!

00:21:12.404 --> 00:21:12.964
Huh?

00:21:12.964 --> 00:21:14.774
WHAT?!

00:21:14.774 --> 00:21:19.174
From the pastry eating competition
to the giant anteater competition,

00:21:19.174 --> 00:21:23.914
Miss Yoshikawa completed a rare sweep
of all forty food-related events!

00:21:23.914 --> 00:21:25.544
What the heck?!

00:21:25.544 --> 00:21:27.444
I almost got myself killed for this?!

00:21:27.814 --> 00:21:28.444
Program
Activated

00:21:29.654 --> 00:21:30.944
Huh?

00:21:36.524 --> 00:21:38.554
Congratulations, Chiaki.

00:21:44.364 --> 00:21:46.834
Big Bro just gave me a kiss!

00:21:48.904 --> 00:21:51.134
Huh? What am I doing up here?

00:21:51.704 --> 00:21:53.144
What's going on?!

00:21:53.144 --> 00:21:55.474
No one said he was going to kiss you on the lips!

00:21:55.474 --> 00:21:58.964
Wh-What if I had won the race...

00:22:00.544 --> 00:22:02.544
Oh, no! Miss Yuri!

00:22:03.454 --> 00:22:05.754
Oh well, what are you gonna do...

00:22:10.294 --> 00:22:13.264
MAGIKANO

00:22:19.764 --> 00:22:26.174
Naisho dakedo watashitte chigau no chotto

00:22:26.174 --> 00:22:32.384
Futsuu desu ka kawaiku mieru no Yeah! Yeah!

00:22:32.384 --> 00:22:38.924
Heiwa desu yo heibon dakedo ii jan? Li jan

00:22:38.924 --> 00:22:45.394
Sou omotte tara toraburu no tane ni konran

00:22:45.394 --> 00:22:51.704
Makenai watasanai wa taisetsu na anata

00:22:51.704 --> 00:22:58.234
Jumon wo tonaecha ikenai kamo ne

00:22:59.674 --> 00:23:06.084
Mahou no sei ja iya nanda mon

00:23:06.084 --> 00:23:12.624
Suki suki dake wa maji ga ii

00:23:12.624 --> 00:23:19.024
Anata wa dare ni koi shiteru

00:23:19.024 --> 00:23:25.204
Kotae wo minna matteru no

00:23:25.204 --> 00:23:28.504
Maji maji kore kara hajimaru
soudatsusen kara mamoranakucha

00:23:28.504 --> 00:23:29.974
Pinchi de panchi ga chirari rari

00:23:37.674 --> 00:23:42.084
Vengeful Michiru turns the stage at the
school cultural festival into a maze!

00:23:42.414 --> 00:23:45.754
Haruo, who's been kidnapped,
remains asleep inside the castle.

00:23:46.284 --> 00:23:50.484
Ayumi and the others try to rescue him
but find themselves in a desperate situation.

00:23:50.994 --> 00:23:54.224
Who is the person who's been
watching them behind the scenes?

00:23:54.324 --> 00:23:56.524
And what fate awaits Haruo?

00:23:57.194 --> 00:24:00.864
Next time on Magikano:
"Magi? He's a Sleeping Prince?"

00:24:01.304 --> 00:24:03.964
The fog of war summons Magikano!
